<title>USA: Universal Outdoor buys Klein Outdoor.</title>
<headline>Universal Outdoor buys Klein Outdoor.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Universal Outdoor Inc said Monday it completed its acquisition of the assets of Klein Outdoor Advertising Inc of New Jersey for about $5.3 million in cash.</p>
<p>The assets include 12 built display faces and about 35 unbuilt displays, Universal Outdoor said.</p>
<p>Universal Outdoor operates 31,200 displays in 23 states.</p>
<p>Its shares closed up 1-3/4 Monday at 28-3/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
